    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0470" n="458" xml:id="pg458"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24591/3: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-03-18T22:00:00-04:00">March 18, 1943—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>132. Your 23, January 8 and 20, February 23. The Department is sending by airmail
                    a draft agreement<anchor n="37" xml:id="d489-f1"/> relating to the entry into
                    and presence in Iran of armed forces and other agencies of the United States of
                    America, together with the President’s full power authorizing you to negotiate,
                    conclude and sign such an agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
